@startuml Manager Manage Movie Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Thêm phim mới (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-movies.html" as UI
control "MovieController" as Ctrl
control "CloudinaryService" as CloudSvc
entity "MovieService" as Svc
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Nhập thông tin & chọn file Poster
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/movies (Multipart Form Data)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> CloudSvc: upload(file)
activate CloudSvc
CloudSvc -> CloudSvc: Thực hiện upload qua API Cloudinary
CloudSvc --> Ctrl: Trả về secure_url & public_id
deactivate CloudSvc

Ctrl -> Svc: createMovie(movieDto, imageUrl)
activate Svc
Svc -> Svc: Map DTO to Entity
Svc -> DB: save(movie)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: movieEntity
deactivate DB
Svc --> Ctrl: movieResponseDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created (Success Message)
deactivate Ctrl
UI -> Manager: Hiển thị thông báo thành công & cập nhật bảng
@enduml
